WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:15.717
Bat looked and looked.

2
00:00:15.718 --> 00:00:25.484
The thing that was brown and hard was not there.

3
00:00:25.485 --> 00:00:31.920
This thing was yellow.

4
00:00:31.921 --> 00:00:36.514
This thing was soft.

5
00:00:36.515 --> 00:00:39.359
The thing made a sound.

6
00:00:39.360 --> 00:00:46.411
It said, "Cheep! Cheep!"

7
00:00:46.412 --> 00:00:51.289
Cat said, "Bat, what is this thing?"

8
00:00:51.290 --> 00:00:55.816
"It is a chick!" said Bat.

9
00:00:55.817 --> 00:01:02.163
"It is a soft, yellow chick!"

10
00:01:02.164 --> 00:01:05.123
"I found it," said Bat.

11
00:01:05.124 --> 00:01:14.000
"So it is mine. Right?"

12
00:01:14.001 --> 00:01:17.814
"No," said Cow.

13
00:01:17.815 --> 00:01:51.106
"The chick must go to its mother."

14
00:01:51.107 --> 00:01:56.834
"But you have something too," said Cow.

15
00:01:56.835 --> 00:02:00.229
"What do I have?" said Bat.

16
00:02:00.230 --> 00:02:03.509
"You have a story," said Cow.

17
00:02:03.510 --> 00:02:08.242
"It is about the thing in the barn.

18
00:02:08.243 --> 00:02:18.984
You can tell this story to your friends."

19
00:02:18.985 --> 00:02:25.810
And that is what Bat did.

